<title>GERMANY: Volkswagen marketing boss Dahlhoff to leave.</title>
<headline>Volkswagen marketing boss Dahlhoff to leave.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Volkswagen AG said the head of its marketing department Dieter Dahlhoff will step down at the end of the year, the company said on Friday.</p>
<p>Dahlhoff said he left the company with &quot;friendly mutual consent.&quot;</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
